{
 "_source": "Shapes only (no colours or pixels) of the tModLoader 1.4.4 player armor layout, at 1x art scale (20x28 per frame). Extracted 2026-10-21 from the vanilla sheets that ship with the tModLoader install (Content/Images/Armor/Armor_71.xnb = a full-coverage body incl. hands, Armor_Legs_60.xnb, Armor_Head_109.xnb), decompressed with FNA's LzxDecoder. Cell meaning from decompiled Terraria.DataStructures.PlayerDrawSet.CreateCompositeData: torso (0,0), torso while jumping (1,0), front shoulder (0,1), back shoulder (1,1), front arm cols 2-6 rows 0-1 (row 0 = item-use frames 0-4, row 1 = jump/walk), back arm cols 2-6 rows 2-3, rotated composite arms col 7 (front) / col 8 (back) rows 0-3 = stretch Full/3-4/1-4/None, female torso and shoulders at rows 2-3 of cols 0-1. Legs: 20 frames. head_bob: art-pixel offset of the head in each of the 20 frames (frames 7-9 and 14-16 sit one pixel higher; Main.OffsetsPlayerHeadgear compensates in game).",
